  "id": "role-confusion",
  "term": "role confusion",
  "definition": "Role confusion is a state of uncertainty or strain about what a person is expected to do when different roles or demands overlap. In this packet, it refers to distress linked to competing professional expectations and difficulty balancing work and personal life.",
